cket over a plain white t-shirt and blue jeans — NOT the fitness tank and compression shorts from <Picture 2> — the jacket slightly open showing the relaxed oversized fit. Soft uniform natural lighting, normal exposure, 16:9 widescreen, calm premium streetwear tone.\n[Shot 1] EYE-LEVEL direct front full-body shot; the camera slowly pushes in, the loose oversized fit of <Subject 1> is clearly shown; <Subject 2> keeps a natural standing pose facing the camera but NEVER walks toward it. EXACT COLOR LOCK: backdrop smooth white wall (#F5F5F5–#FFFFFF), jacket near-black #0A0A0A, white tee, blue jeans — all must stay IDENTICAL, never washed out. No impossible camera movement. No background patterns, no concentric circles, no ring patterns, no halos, no radial gradients, no wall stains, no decorations. <Subject 2> says in an off-screen voiceover (S1): <d>[zh] 黑色连帽外套，宽松不挑人。</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, cut to a 45-DEGREE side medium shot; <Subject 2> makes a natural turn, <Subject 1> drapes naturally over the body proving the versatile fit, white tee and blue jeans visible underneath; the camera arcs slowly with the motion, never facing the lens directly; the backdrop stays a smooth white wall, no decorations. No extra people, no extra props, no duplicate parts. <Subject 2> says in an off-screen voiceover (S1): <d>[zh] 纯黑百搭，</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, cut back to a near-medium shot; <Subject 2> raises one hand to adjust the hood drawstring, then holds still as the poster-style product hero freeze frame. <Subject 1> stays identical to <Picture 1>, near-black #0A0A0A with metallic zipper pull and drawstring tips. No text, no logo, no watermark, no embedded subtitles; no face distortion; strictly follow gravity and natural motion. <Subject 2> says in an off-screen voiceover (S1): <d>[zh] 牛仔工装运动都接得住。</d>\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSubtle quiet indoor ambient sound, clean and stable across all shots.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nLight minimal background music, calm premium streetwear ton